{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50655","headline":"遥知（友人陈九思同志疑「知」乃「和」字之讹）元九送王行周游越 · 李绅","name":"遥知（友人陈九思同志疑「知」乃「和」字之讹）元九送王行周游越","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江湖随月盈还宿，沙渚依潮断更连。\n伍相庙中多白浪，越王台畔少晴烟。\n低头绿草羞枚乘，刺眼红花笑杜鹃。\n莫倚西施旧苔石，由来破国是神仙。\n（见韦庄《又玄集》卷中。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50655.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50655","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}